{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{!--
  An invitation to sign in to a dashboard's public link (#10250), or a
  form's: its link sets the private user's first password, and works for a
  day (Server/Services/PrivateUserServiceBase). The resource's name is chosen
  by its team, so every line that carries it is printed through plainInfo -
  escaped - never through the raw `info`.
--}}

{{> EmailTitle title="You're invited to sign in" }}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat "You have been invited to " resourceName ". Choose a password to sign in and open it.")}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=tokenVerifyUrl buttonText="Choose a Password"}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=tokenVerifyUrl linkLabel="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}

{{> InfoBlock info="The link works for 24 hours. Once it has run out, open the sign-in page and use Forgot password to get a new one."}}

{{> InfoBlock info="<strong>Not expecting this?</strong> You can safely ignore this email. Nothing happens until somebody uses the link above."}}

{{> InfoBlock info="Thanks, have a great day."}}

{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(concat resourceName " Team.")}}
{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> End this}}
